    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to immerse yourself in a thrilling and terrifying adventure with 'SHIRIME 2: The Genesis of Butt-Eye' where you will discover what drove Sharon to search for the monster with an eye in place of its a**s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/9ed7ff80dd5abbee691bfcf0a1f65a57.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/9ed7ff80dd5abbee691bfcf0a1f65a57.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/9ed7ff80dd5abbee691bfcf0a1f65a57.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third-person perspective: In this installment, you will traverse an intricate and detailed world with a third-person perspective, allowing you to explore the surrounding environment from a broader viewpoint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/775e7aa5c14b97632d9ae73f653faec6.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/775e7aa5c14b97632d9ae73f653faec6.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/775e7aa5c14b97632d9ae73f653faec6.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling combat: Challenge Shirime and its allies in intense and adrenaline-fueled battles. Use your guns to take down enemies and defend yourself against their lethal supernatural abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/d66548a50f1a3b0cd52e43929ff153b9.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/d66548a50f1a3b0cd52e43929ff153b9.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this sequel, in addition to the forest where the prologue is focused, you will explore an old inn steeped in mysteries as you try to unveil the origin of the Butt-Eye Curse in this exciting new chapter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ARE YOU READY TO FACE THE CURSE HEAD-ON?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/6b844801a1b568145e0068eb072d6fa8.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/6b844801a1b568145e0068eb072d6fa8.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/6b844801a1b568145e0068eb072d6fa8.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't miss the First Chapter of Shirime's fantastic saga!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/ca3c3a155f7e4ec18eb9da39134562d6.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/ca3c3a155f7e4ec18eb9da39134562d6.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/ca3c3a155f7e4ec18eb9da39134562d6.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if you want to save Jennifer's Life, Don't forget to <strong>ADD 'UNFOLLOW' TO YOUR WISHLIST!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/68a20ed0fb06369b630b4be967f9efc2.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/68a20ed0fb06369b630b4be967f9efc2.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/68a20ed0fb06369b630b4be967f9efc2.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THANK YOU FROM ALL OF A$$!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to immerse yourself in a thrilling and terrifying adventure with 'SHIRIME 2: The Genesis of Butt-Eye' where you will discover what drove Sharon to search for the monster with an eye in place of its a**s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/9ed7ff80dd5abbee691bfcf0a1f65a57.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/9ed7ff80dd5abbee691bfcf0a1f65a57.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/9ed7ff80dd5abbee691bfcf0a1f65a57.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third-person perspective: In this installment, you will traverse an intricate and detailed world with a third-person perspective, allowing you to explore the surrounding environment from a broader viewpoint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/775e7aa5c14b97632d9ae73f653faec6.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/775e7aa5c14b97632d9ae73f653faec6.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/775e7aa5c14b97632d9ae73f653faec6.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling combat: Challenge Shirime and its allies in intense and adrenaline-fueled battles. Use your guns to take down enemies and defend yourself against their lethal supernatural abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/d66548a50f1a3b0cd52e43929ff153b9.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/d66548a50f1a3b0cd52e43929ff153b9.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this sequel, in addition to the forest where the prologue is focused, you will explore an old inn steeped in mysteries as you try to unveil the origin of the Butt-Eye Curse in this exciting new chapter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ARE YOU READY TO FACE THE CURSE HEAD-ON?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/6b844801a1b568145e0068eb072d6fa8.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/6b844801a1b568145e0068eb072d6fa8.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/6b844801a1b568145e0068eb072d6fa8.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't miss the First Chapter of Shirime's fantastic saga!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/ca3c3a155f7e4ec18eb9da39134562d6.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/ca3c3a155f7e4ec18eb9da39134562d6.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/ca3c3a155f7e4ec18eb9da39134562d6.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And if you want to save Jennifer's Life, Don't forget to <strong>ADD 'UNFOLLOW' TO YOUR WISHLIST!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/68a20ed0fb06369b630b4be967f9efc2.poster.avif?t=1728991579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/68a20ed0fb06369b630b4be967f9efc2.webm?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103440/extras/68a20ed0fb06369b630b4be967f9efc2.mp4?t=1728991579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THANK YOU FROM ALL OF A$$!</p>",
